{
  "$schema": "personal-world/design-tokens/1",
  "_comment": "PROVENANCE (merged 2026-09-22): this nested schema is the live contract — ui/scripts/generate-tokens.mjs, contrast-audit.mjs and tests/test_design_tokens.py all read it. The pre-merge trunk file was a FLAT aubergine-era baseline with the note 'historical baseline, do not fix the sibling to match'; the sibling is now this file, and the baseline lives on in git history (main @ 6bb7346 blob) and in design/themes/station.json. Status vocabulary and immutable targets/focus/motion are canonical here; themes supply palettes. Semantic design token definitions. These are the NAMES — the contract. Values come from theme files in themes/. Never put hex values here.",
